{
 "description": "Real Windows Media Audio Voice files from the FFmpeg sample archive: ten ASF files of Microsoft's \"Windows Media 9 Speech Codec\" samples (A-codecs/WMSP: 4, 8 and 16 kbit/s, progressive and streaming muxes, one cut to a length, one with a broken end, one whose superframes hold music) and an ASF video file with a Voice track (A-codecs/WMA9/WMAVoice). None may be redistributed here, so they are downloaded and checked against their SHA-256 rather than committed. Per file: what the analyzer, ffprobe, ffmpeg and MediaInfo must report, the codes of the analyzer's warnings and errors (\"findings\") and of its infos (\"info_findings\"), each as a set. \"archived\": false marks a file the Wayback Machine has no capture of (its availability API, October 2026), so no Wayback address is listed for it.",
 "sources": {
  "ffmpeg": {
   "page": "https://samples.ffmpeg.org/A-codecs/WMSP/",
   "terms": "The FFmpeg sample archive's 00-README: \"You are free to download any samples you want\". They are downloaded and checked, not committed."
  }
 },
